  "data": {
    "body": "Which of the following expressions will evaluate as TRUE for all leap years and FALSE otherwise?\n<br><i>Note:</i> A year is a leap year if:<br><ul><li>it IS divisible by 4 AND NOT divisible by 100</li><li>OR it is divisible by 400</li></ul>",
